  title     = {Meaningful Change in Depression Symptoms Assessed with the {Patient Health Questionnaire} ({PHQ-9}) and {Montgomery-{\AA}sberg Depression Rating Scale} ({MADRS}) Among Patients with Treatment Resistant Depression in Two, Randomized, Double-blind, Active-controlled Trials of Esketamine Nasal Spray Combined With a New Oral Antidepressant},
